    "body": "Wow, I managed to completely miss that change in 9110!! Thank you @mnot and @annevk for that. Unfortunately, given that there are deployed applications out there that are still using payloads in GETs, runtimes are still going to need to deal with this case but given this I agree that changing the spec on this isn't worthwhile. I appreciate the quick turnaround on the discussion and will close this :-) ",
